  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to draw on the power of the Shadow­fell, gaining the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Darkness.</strong> You can expend 1 Focus Point to cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplDarkness00]{Darkness} spell without spell components. You can see within the spell's area when you cast it with this feature. While the spell persists, you can move its area of Darkness to a space within 60 feet of yourself at the start of each of your turns.</p><p><strong>Darkvision.</strong> You gain Darkvision with a range of 60 feet. If you already have Darkvision, its range increases by 60 feet.</p><p><strong>Shadowy Figments.</strong> You know the Minor Illusion spell. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-wd4smhB7uw8Awq0x\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Expend Focus Point</strong> activity expends a use and you can then use the [[/item Darkness]] spell which is granted to you at this level.</p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect that increases your Darkvision.</p><p>You are granted the Minor Illusion spell when you reach this level.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
